      "slot_id": "slot-e8afc2bd-8874-4b14-9851-9d81b5a774de",
      "name": "closeout funding plan",
      "value": "2",
      "unit": "billion dollars",
      "sentence": "The Office of Management and Budget, headed by Russel T. Vought and charged with shutting down U.S.A.I.D., in April notified Congress of a plan to use $2 billion of global health money for “closeout costs” for grants from the dismantled U.S.A.I.D. — costs such as severance to employees and terminating leases for office space around the world.",
      "occurrence_id": "occurrence-743d6613ea4f207b81240eda0ee01dad4801bfda14bb193abd4d3b00b0707064-18fef9047d0d86f2"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "slot-37e686dd-da72-4c8b-a518-8b279272e33a",
      "name": "redirected funds",
      "value": "650",
      "unit": "million dollars",
      "sentence": "Since that notification, about $650 million of those funds have been redirected for the Ebola response and other global health security efforts.",
      "occurrence_id": "occurrence-743d6613ea4f207b81240eda0ee01dad4801bfda14bb193abd4d3b00b0707064-5d9867ac409dd226"
    },
    {
      "slot_id": "slot-d924e2ce-3a70-45fb-a46c-680083f400b9",
      "name": "remaining closeout funds",
      "value": "1.35",
      "unit": "billion dollars",
      "sentence": "But $1.35 billion, which has to be used by Sept. 30, remains marked by the O.M.B. for closeout costs.",
      "occurrence_id": "occurrence-743d6613ea4f207b81240eda0ee01dad4801bfda14bb193abd4d3b00b0707064-050583b1dcfb49bf"
